@startuml Component_Diagram
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 50

actor "Người dùng\n(Sinh viên/Giảng viên)" as User

node "Docker Host / Máy chủ" {
    
    component "Nginx (Reverse Proxy & Static Server)" as Nginx {
        [React UI Static Files]
    }

    package "Backend Service" {
        [FastAPI App (REST API)] as FastAPI
    }

    package "AI Background Worker" {
        [Celery Worker] as Celery
        note right of Celery : Sử dụng DeepFace\nvà MTCNN
    }

    package "Data & Storage Layer" {
        database "Redis" as Redis
        note right of Redis : Task Queue &\nMessage Broker
        
        database "MySQL" as MySQL
        note right of MySQL : Lưu User, Logs
        
        database "Qdrant" as Qdrant
        note right of Qdrant : Vector Database
        
        database "MinIO" as MinIO
        note right of MinIO : Object Storage\n(Lưu ảnh)
    }
}

User -right-> Nginx : HTTP/HTTPS (Port 80)
Nginx --> FastAPI : Phân luồng API (/api)

FastAPI --> MinIO : Upload/Download ảnh
FastAPI --> MySQL : Đọc/Ghi dữ liệu (SQLAlchemy)
FastAPI -down-> Redis : Đẩy Task nhận diện

Redis <-down- Celery : Lấy Task cần xử lý
Celery -up-> MinIO : Tải ảnh gốc để xử lý
Celery -up-> Qdrant : Extract & Search Vector
Celery -up-> Redis : Trả kết quả Task

@enduml